{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43484","headline":"玉壶冰 · 无名氏","name":"玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄律阴风劲，坚冰在玉壶。\n暗中花更出，晓後色全无。\n涸沍谁能伴，凄清讵可渝。\n任圆空似璧，照物不成珠。\n素质情方契，孤明道岂殊。\n幽人若相比，还得咏生刍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43484.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43484","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}